msgid ""
"With Isaac running and ROS 2 topics/services up, motion and recording talk "
"to the robot through **ros2_robot_interface**, orchestrated by "
"**robot_action_composer**. Continue at [Interface and "
"orchestration](2-orchestration.md)."
